g", 'Kumena, Tyrant of Orazca', 'Legion Conquistador', 'Legion Lieutenant', 'Luminous Bonds', 'Majestic Heliopterus', 'Martyr of Dusk', "Mastermind's Acquisition", 'Mausoleum Harpy', 'Merfolk Mistbinder', 'Mist-Cloaked Herald', 'Moment of Craving', 'Moment of Triumph', 'Mountain', 'Mutiny', 'Naturalize', 'Needletooth Raptor', 'Negate', 'Nezahal, Primal Tide', 'Oathsworn Vampire', 'Orazca Frillback', 'Orazca Raptor', 'Orazca Relic', 'Overgrown Armasaur', 'Paladin of Atonement', 'Path of Discovery', 'Path of Mettle // Metzali, Tower of Triumph', "Pirate's Pillage", 'Pitiless Plunderer', 'Plains', 'Plummet', 'Polyraptor', 'Pride of Conquerors', 'Profane Procession // Tomb of the Dusk Rose', 'Protean Raider', 'Radiant Destiny', 'Raging Regisaur', 'Raptor Companion', 'Ravenous Chupacabra', 'Reaver Ambush', 'Reckless Rage', 'Recover', 'Rekindling Phoenix', 'Release to the Wind', 'Relentless Raptor', 'Resplendent Griffin', 'River Darter', 'Riverwise Augur', 'Sadistic Skymarcher', 'Sailor of Means', 'Sanguine Glorifier', 'Sea Legs', 'Seafloor Oracle', 'Secrets of the Golden City', 'See Red', 'Shake the Foundations', 'Shatter', 'Siegehorn Ceratops', 'Silent Gravestone', 'Silverclad Ferocidons', 'Silvergill Adept', 'Siren Reaver', 'Skymarcher Aspirant', 'Slaughter the Strong', 'Slippery Scoundrel', 'Snubhorn Sentry', 'Soul of the Rapids', "Sphinx's Decree", 'Spire Winder', "Squire's Devotion", 'Stampeding Horncrest', 'Stone Quarry', 'Storm Fleet Sprinter', 'Storm Fleet Swashbuckler', 'Storm the Vault // Vault of Catlacan', 'Strength of the Pack', 'Strider Harness', 'Sun Sentinel', 'Sun-Collared Raptor', 'Sun-Crested Pterodon', 'Swab Goblin', 'Swaggering Corsair', 'Swamp', 'Swift Warden', 'Sworn Guardian', 'Temple Altisaur', 'Tendershoot Dryad', 'Tetzimoc, Primal Death', 'The Immortal Sun', 'Thrashing Brontodon', 'Thunderherd Migration', "Tilonalli's Crown", "Tilonalli's Summoner", 'Timestream Navigator', 'Tomb Robber', 'Trapjaw Tyrant', "Traveler's Amulet", 'Twilight Prophet'